      "limitations": "Modelled/reanalysis weather, not a gauge or on-farm measurement. PRECTOTCORR is bias-corrected model precipitation (mm/day); daily values are Local Solar Time days. Five years (2021-2025) are historical examples, not climate normals or a trend. Fill value -999 is treated as missing (null); monthly precipitation is null unless every day is valid."
